      "html": "<p class=\"provider-bio\">Our Ogden Medical Plaza clinic serves the Weber County community with medical oncology and hematology care. Conveniently located along the 5300 S. corridor, this clinic provides infusion therapy, on-site laboratory services, and the full support of the Utah Cancer Specialists care team — so patients in northern Utah can receive expert cancer care close to home.</p>",
